@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title CP — intended improvement versus demonstrated result
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Explicit matched baseline case\nActual goal/data/context/method and observed outcome required" as Baseline
rectangle "Actual candidate workflow case\nSame defined comparison meaning; material differences visible" as Candidate
rectangle "Compare actual outcomes / effort / correctness\nRecord uncertainty and unintended effects" as Compare
rectangle "Only bounded evidence-supported improvement claim\nNo baseline or candidate run means no demonstrated gain" as Result #17405A
Baseline --> Compare
Candidate --> Compare
Compare --> Result
note bottom of Result
A cleaner diagram or unified screen does not prove efficiency/usability.
Preserve accepted scope, independent tailoring and actual history.
end note

legend bottom
Source-based analysis; target behavior and hypotheses are not observed current task sequences.
No interview, business-task timing, live product/reference inspection or improvement test performed.
endlegend
@enduml
